{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>石硤尾邨有住客疑猝死家中。今日（17日）早上約9時半，警方接獲上址保安員報案，指大廈一單位傳出異味。</p><p>消防趕抵破門而入，發現姓葉（65歲）男住戶倒臥屋內，已明顯死亡。警方將案件列作「屍體發現」處理，將安排驗屍確定死因。</p><figure><img alt=\"石硤尾邨有一名六旬男住客倒斃家中。（Google Maps 截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199352085854818304596830.jpeg/6D_eTcKl5AGMIKxyVxNb-fjBMRZ3_UTJGptp4hqbaeI\"/><figcaption>石硤尾邨有一名六旬男住客倒斃家中。（Google Maps 截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T05:49:25.880093+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T05:25:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T12:07:13.663864+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T05:42:37.640444+00:00","content_hash":"b32414c40cd5325e8a07f324e58f16c8355095e1df95ef3d615090b82fade930","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}